        "date": "2026-11-13T22:45:04Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(import): refuse a STEP closed shell that meshes open, by name\n\ntruck drops a face it cannot place a boundary on, and mis-trims one it\nplaces wrongly, without an error. A shell the file declares closed\n(CLOSED_SHELL, or a MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREP's outer) whose kept mesh has\nunmatched edges is now refused, naming the shell, its face count, the\nunmatched-edge count, the first edge and any face the kernel gave no mesh;\na face with no mesh is refused in an open shell too.\n\nFixes #1573\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
